---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.js';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | Printablery';
const description = 'How Printablery handles data, cookies, and advertising.';
const updated = 'August 2026';
// NOTE: This is a standard starting template. Have it reviewed by someone
// qualified before relying on it, and keep it accurate to what you actually run.
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/privacy/" noindex={false}>
  <section class="wrap narrow" style="padding-top:2.2rem;">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt0">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how {SITE.name} (“we,” “us”) handles information when you use {SITE.domain}.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>Printablery is designed to work without accounts. We do not ask you to register, and the words you type into the bingo generator are processed in your browser to build and print cards — they are not required to be sent to or stored on our servers to use the tool.</p>
      <p>Like most websites, we and our service providers may automatically collect standard technical information such as your browser type, device type, general location, and pages visited, through cookies and similar technologies, for analytics and advertising.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
      <p>We use advertising to keep Printablery free. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
        <li>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
        <li>You can opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info/choices</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Consent for visitors in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland</h2>
      <p>If you are located in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom, or Switzerland, we present a consent choice through a certified consent management platform before non-essential cookies (including advertising cookies) are set. You can change your choice at any time through the privacy settings link served by that consent tool.</p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>We may use privacy-conscious analytics to understand which themes and pages are useful, in aggregate. This helps us decide what to build next.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Printablery makes printable materials often used in classrooms, but the website is intended for use by adults (teachers, parents, hosts). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings and through the ad-choice links above. Blocking some cookies may affect advertising but will not prevent you from making and printing cards.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy as the site evolves. Material changes will be reflected by the “last updated” date above.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to the contact address published on our site.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
